      "title": "使用说明与模型下载",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## FLUX.1 Fill FP8 漫画完整遮罩修复\n\n界面上分别选择漫画原图和同尺寸黑白 mask。mask 中白色区域会进行语义补画，黑色区域保持原图。完整 mask 一次处理，不需要拆分。\n\n### 模型文件\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- `flux1-Fill-Dev_FP8.safetensors`\n- https://huggingface.co/fofr/comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/flux1-Fill-Dev_FP8.safetensors\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- `clip_l.safetensors`\n- https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/clip_l.safetensors\n- `t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors`\n- https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n\n**vae**\n\n- `ae.safetensors`\n- https://huggingface.co/fofr/comfyui/resolve/main/vae/ae.safetensors\n\n### 放置目录\n\n```\nComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux1-Fill-Dev_FP8.safetensors\nComfyUI/models/text_encoders/clip_l.safetensors\nComfyUI/models/text_encoders/t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\nComfyUI/models/vae/ae.safetensors\n```\n\n下载完成后刷新模型或重启 ComfyUI。默认使用官方结构：20步、Euler、normal、Flux Guidance 30。"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
